    h2(text: "Appendix C. Closed shared-contract compatibility and exact operation selectors"),
    p(text: "Names without a prefix in the first table are in gunbc.fabric. This is an actual constructor/result/forwarding roster at the cited baseline, not a count of imports or evidence that the routes ran. F changes producers, codecs and direct result consumers together; S/M3 own their complete domain cut, and A owns root selection."),
    TableBlock {
      header: row(cells: [cell(text: "Boundary"), cell(text: "Direct sites"), cell(text: "Disposition"), cell(text: "Package")]),
      alignments: [AlignNone, AlignNone, AlignNone, AlignNone],
      rows: [
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Binding elimination"), cell(text: "fabric_storage_client::\{fabric_storage_head, fabric_storage_put, fabric_storage_advance, fabric_storage_closure, fabric_storage_presented_identity\}; fabric_writer_identity_observe::binding_words"), cell(text: "Exactly six current non-test eliminating functions. Every R2 arm needs an explicit disposition, including unsupported head/closure operations until composed. Selection excludes unavailable operations; direct unsupported calls must refuse, never succeed."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Binding construction and observations"), cell(text: "fabric_storage_client::FabricStorageBinding; fabric_storage_binding::\{fabric_storage_binding_for, fabric_state_storage_binding\}; gunbc.compute.host_capacity::compute_capacity_store; fabric_writer_roster::fabric_writer_identity_observations; gunbc.instruments.fabric_event_log_probe::\{fabric_event_log_probe, fabric_event_log_probe_served\}; gunbc.instruments.fabric_partition_read::\{fabric_partition_read_local, fabric_partition_read_served\}; gunbc.instruments.fabric_seat_probe::\{fabric_seat_collision_probe, fabric_seat_collision_probe_from\}"), cell(text: "Preserve existing scopes and valid injected fixtures. Historical LocalFiles observations remain historical; adding R2 is not a reason to rewrite them."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Identity projections"), cell(text: "fabric_writer_identity_observe::\{FabricWriterIdentityReceipt, fabric_writer_identity_observe_wet, fabric_writer_identity_receipt_text, fabric_writer_identity_ground, fabric_writer_identity_reading_grounds_roster\}; fabric_writer_roster::\{recorded_binding, observed_login, fabric_served_writer_roster_of\}"), cell(text: "R2 does not establish a tailnet principal. FabricIdentityUnproxied currently describes local-file access; reusing that explanation for R2 would misstate the observation."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "FabricPut direct arms"), cell(text: "durable_cas_fabric_storage::cas_slot_advance; fabric_event_log::event_log_append_with; fabric_source_snapshot::\{snapshot_store_inclusion, capture_source_snapshot\}; fabric_storage_client::fabric_storage_put; fabric_storage_file_store::fabric_storage_put_from_create; fabric_storage_serve::fabric_served_storage_respond; fabric_storage_wire::\{fabric_storage_wire_put, fabric_storage_unwire_put\}; gunbc.instruments.source_snapshot_handoff::\{escaping_entry_manifest, duplicate_entry_manifest\}"), cell(text: "Update producers, codecs, adapters and consumers in the same contract-changing delivery. Preserve unknown publication and custody without mechanically turning an enclosing transaction into an unknown head update."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "FabricHeadAdvance direct arms"), cell(text: "durable_cas_fabric_storage::cas_slot_advance; fabric_event_log::event_log_append_with; fabric_storage_client::fabric_storage_advance; fabric_storage_file_store::fabric_storage_file_advance; fabric_storage_r2_head::r2_head_fabric_advance; fabric_storage_serve::fabric_served_storage_respond; fabric_storage_wire::\{fabric_storage_wire_advance, fabric_storage_unwire_advance\}; std.checkpointed_workspace::workspace_commit_classify"), cell(text: "Conditional compatibility scope if the head outcome changes. The checkpoint classifier is a real consumer; preserve request/plan binding and coverage advancement."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "FabricObjectGet direct arms"), cell(text: "fabric_object_r2::\{fabric_object_r2_read_of, get_fabric_object_r2, fabric_object_r2_readback_verdict\}; fabric_source_snapshot::\{materialize_source_snapshot, snapshot_materialize_entry_links, snapshot_materialize_step\}; fabric_storage_file_store::\{closure_step, fabric_storage_file_advance, fabric_storage_file_put, fabric_storage_object_from_read, fabric_storage_put_from_create\}; workspace_checkpoint_instrument::workspace_stored_entry_read"), cell(text: "Carry the existing verified-object result through the shared route; retain missing/corrupt/refused distinctions and staging custody."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Forwarding and served route"), cell(text: "fabric_storage_file_store::\{fabric_storage_file_put, fabric_storage_file_get\}; fabric_object_r2::\{FabricObjectR2Get, fabric_object_r2_put_verdict\}; fabric_storage_protocol::fabric_storage_respond; fabric_storage_client::\{door_post, served_post\}; fabric_storage_state_auth::\{fabric_state_operation,fabric_state_sign,fabric_state_verify,fabric_state_decode_verified\}; fabric_storage_state_serve::fabric_storage_state_serve_over; fabric_storage_state_auth_io::fabric_state_keyring"), cell(text: "Signature/forwarding changes are part of the same package. Get preserves the selected binding's admission and namespace. Protected-state get uses its existing signature and separate private root; public served, host-local and R2 bindings retain their respective access routes."), cell(text: "F")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Source-snapshot concrete-root operands"), cell(text: "fabric_source_snapshot::\{snapshot_store_inclusion, snapshot_capture_step, capture_source_snapshot, snapshot_materialize_entry_links, snapshot_materialize_entry, snapshot_materialize_step, materialize_source_snapshot\}"), cell(text: "Replace all seven concrete dependencies. Reuse SnapshotCaptureRefusal, SnapshotCapture, SnapshotCaptureAcc, snapshot_capture_refuse and corresponding SnapshotMaterializeRefusal, SnapshotMaterialization, SnapshotMaterializeAcc, snapshot_materialize_refuse as the local result-plumbing sites."), cell(text: "S")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Only external store-bound snapshot consumer"), cell(text: "gunbc.instruments.source_snapshot_handoff::\{SnapshotWorkspace, prepare_snapshot_workspace, capture_for_scenario, capture_refusal_wire, snapshot_refusal_wire, materialize_refused_for_wrong_reason, run_executed_request_scenario, run_corrupted_bytes_scenario, run_missing_object_scenario, run_composition_mismatch_scenario, run_escaping_path_scenario, run_duplicate_path_scenario, escaping_entry_manifest, duplicate_entry_manifest, authored_object_path, run_snapshot_scenario, source_snapshot_handoff\}"), cell(text: "Ordinary capture/materialization loses concrete file access. Deliberate corruption/hole fixtures remain isolated file-provider controls, not raw-path overrides on normal selection."), cell(text: "S")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Checkpoint composition"), cell(text: "workspace_checkpoint_instrument::workspace_instrument_commit_admitted -> fabric_storage_r2_head::r2_head_fabric_advance -> std.checkpointed_workspace::workspace_commit_classify; workspace_checkpoint_instrument::workspace_stored_entry_read"), cell(text: "M3 migrates the complete checkpoint cohort after F result compatibility is available. Object and head authority, request/plan binding and coverage advancement remain coherent."), cell(text: "M3")]),
        row(cells: [cell(text: "Default protected-state binding callers"), cell(text: "gunbc.live_deploy.apply::live_deploy_apply_admitted_via_transport; gunbc.roadmap.roadmap_runtime_plan::roadmap_plan_projection; gunbc.roadmap.roadmap_serve::serve_issue_create_response_over; gunbc.roadmap.workspace_allocation_routes::\{workspace_route_create, workspace_route_get, workspace_route_list, workspace_route_release\}; gunbc.runner.runner_microvm_slot_controller::workspace_slot_dispatch_launch; gunbc.workspace_allocation_dispatch::\{workspace_allocation_prepare, workspace_allocation_readback_cli, workspace_allocation_selected, workspace_publish_preparation_wait\}; gunbc.workspace_host_offer_observe::workspace_observe_slot_offer; gunbc.workspace_operator_request::\{workspace_operator_observe_wet, workspace_operator_release_wet, workspace_operator_request_wet\}"), cell(text: "Supply selection at these existing roots in the A cut; preserve protected-state admission and exact state continuity. The snapshot does not change their authority incidentally. F carries new get/list/uncertainty through the signed route."), cell(text: "A")]),
      ],
    },
    p(text: "Result-contract evidence remains test.claim.fabric.\{fabric_storage_file_store_wet_witness,fabric_storage_wire_witness,fabric_state_namespace_wet_witness,fabric_event_log_wet_witness\}, test.claim.durable_cas_fabric_storage_real_execution, test.claim.std_checkpointed_workspace and test.claim.workspace_checkpoint_instrument. Identity evidence is test.claim.fabric.fabric_writer_identity_observe_witness and fabric_writer_roster_witness. Preserve request-bound classification, unknown-put controls and true observed identity; an R2 route does not mint a tailnet identity. Other valid local/served/unplaced fixtures remain provider controls, not additional domain stores."),
    h3(text: "Claim function cut (C2)"),
    p(text: "Seven functions have 13 direct calls: eight internal, two external production and three external test calls. Broader process roots appear in section 6 and Appendix A. Confined codec/lifecycle admit_callers references move with their domain producers; the unused witness import is not an extra call."),
