    p(text: "Provisioning entrances: roadmap_dashboard_instance_apply::\{dashboard_instance_ensure_roots_cli,macbook_local_ensure_roots_cli,srv2_deploy_ensure_roots_cli,srv1_lab_dashboard_apply_wet,srv2_lab_dashboard_apply_wet,srv1_lab_dashboard_preflight,srv1_lab_dashboard_preflight_json,srv2_lab_dashboard_preflight,srv2_lab_dashboard_preflight_json\}; live_deploy.apply::\{live_deploy_apply_desired_wet,live_deploy_apply_desired_operator_local_wet,live_deploy_apply_prod_role_wet,live_deploy_apply_prod_role_operator_wet,live_deploy_apply_prod_role_operator_local_wet,live_deploy_apply_prod_role_transaction_wet\}. Preserve their deployment/revision/access admission. C2 also disposes retract_legs and runner_host_privileged_operations as section 6 requires."),
