    p(text: "Additional selectors: FabricStorageBinding and its LocalFiles/DoorSocket/Served/Unplaced/Refused arms; FabricPut/FabricHeadAdvance/FabricObjectGet and constructors; fabric_storage_(put|head|advance|closure|file_get|file_root_ensure); r2_(put_staged_file|fetch_into_staging|release_staging); roadmap_event_(append|publish|read|carrier|snapshot); local_store_(initialize|open|read|commit). Follow typed argv constructors and embedded command plans to the actual process roots, not only Filesystem call text."),
